                "text": "<div class=\"summary-container\"><div class=\"summary-text\"><p>I developed a convolutional neural network (CNN) to predict vehicle steering for autonomous driving, enabling my robot to navigate both urban and rural roads. The model processed RGB camera images to generate real-time steering commands, incorporated stop sign detection, and dynamically adjusted speed based on road conditions. After extensive data collection, training, and deployment on a Raspberry Pi-controlled robot, I secured 1st place in the Need4Speed Challenge at RVSS 2025, demonstrating exceptional performance in autonomous navigation and real-world adaptability.</p></div><div class=\"summary-media\"><img src=\"images/software/Autonomous_Driving_ML/Autonomous_Driving.jpg\" alt=\"Autonomous Driving\" /></div></div><div class=\"summary-row\"><img src=\"images/software/Autonomous_Driving_ML/Team_Photo.jpg\" alt=\"Team Winning Photo\" /><img src=\"images/software/Autonomous_Driving_ML/Competition_Day.jpg\" alt=\"Competition Photo\" /></div><div class=\"summary-video\"><div class=\"video-container\"><iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ji1zX4laue0\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></div>"
